{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDVk9JRU1B94T5sjhLLz", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "在桑给巴尔（Zanzibar），Harees 叫 **Boko boko**（也写作 Bokoboko），可以用羊肉、牛肉或鸡肉做。\n\n这个名字有两类来源能对上：几个转载维基百科 Harees 词条的镜像站都这么写；肯尼亚《The Standard》的菜谱文章和 Clovegarden 的菜谱也把这道东非海岸的小麦炖肉叫 boko boko。我没有直接看到 wikipedia.org 原站的页面。搜了 2 次。\n\n依据：\n- [encycloreader.org – Harees（维基百科镜像）](https://encycloreader.org/r/wikipedia.php?q=Harees)\n- [en.Wikipedia.com/wiki/Harees（维基百科镜像）](https://en.Wikipedia.com/wiki/Harees)\n- [The Standard (Kenya) – Easy recipe: Swahili boko boko delight](https://www.standardmedia.co.ke/evewoman/living/article/2001500896/easy-recipe-swahili-boko-boko-delight)\n- [Clovegarden – Dish of Beef & Wheat Bokoboko](https://clovegarden.com/recipes/qmm_cowwht1.html)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1353, "cache_read_input_tokens": 5356, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1353}, "output_tokens": 6, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:34:02.899Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDVk924FFVpqmscbCefB"}
